            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 room-media-side">
            <div class="room-carousel">
                <div class="carousel-track">
                    <img src="~/images/house/IMG_4621.JPG" alt="Boerderij, foto 1 van 3" class="carousel-img active" />
                    <img src="~/images/house/IMG_4623.JPG" alt="Boerderij, foto 2 van 3" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
                    <img src="~/images/house/IMG_4787.JPG" alt="Boerderij, foto 3 van 3" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="carousel-controls">
                    <button type="button" class="carousel-btn prev-btn" aria-label="Vorige foto">‹</button>
